WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:02.990
Unit three. Healthy Food!

2
00:00:03.942 --> 00:00:07.983
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:11.197
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.247 --> 00:00:14.815
Today we learn about Healthy Food. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.773 --> 00:00:19.073
Fruit. Say it with me. Fruit!

6
00:00:22.593 --> 00:00:26.160
Vegetable. Say it with me. Vegetable!

7
00:00:29.658 --> 00:00:32.875
Rice. Say it with me. Rice!

8
00:00:36.388 --> 00:00:39.955
Milk. Say it with me. Milk!

9
00:00:43.448 --> 00:00:46.982
Water. Say it with me. Water!

10
00:00:50.481 --> 00:00:54.181
Snack. Say it with me. Snack!

11
00:00:57.669 --> 00:01:00.919
Meal. Say it with me. Meal!

12
00:01:04.402 --> 00:01:07.902
Healthy. Say it with me. Healthy!

13
00:01:11.423 --> 00:01:19.654
Eating fruit and vegetables every day keeps my body healthy. I drink milk and water instead of sugary drinks. Rice is part of my main meal.

14
00:01:19.704 --> 00:01:20.907
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.304 --> 00:01:27.643
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.693 --> 00:01:28.843
Rice!

17
00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:35.050
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:36.250
Meal!

19
00:01:36.975 --> 00:01:43.140
Did you know? Eating colorful fruits and vegetables gives your body many different vitamins!

20
00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:45.175
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.934 --> 00:01:53.163
Think and answer. What is your favorite healthy food?

22
00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:54.363
Great answer!

23
00:01:55.402 --> 00:02:00.475
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.525 --> 00:02:03.273
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

